This is an independent implementation of a network protocol, produced by
analysing how an existing client program communicates, for the purpose of
interoperability. It contains no code, artwork, audio, text or data files
taken from KONAMI's software. Message names, map names and structure
offsets appear here because they are the identifiers the protocol itself
uses.

